> Not if your talking to an alien by radio in binary star solar system :-)

{namcu zei solri} is a lujvo, so in principle its sense can be anything
at all, even including 1 in a world with 2 suns. In practice the meaning
of lujvo are constrained by the meanings of their parts, but notwith-
standing this, the meaning of the whole can be true even if the meaning
of the parts isn't.
